n</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Worker thread batching<=
/strong> prevents main thread blocking during heavy comparison loads</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Streaming processing</s=
trong> keeps memory usage constant regardless of document size</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Adaptive strategy selec=
tion</strong> optimizes for different document characteristics</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">This architecture can easily han=
